  "notes": [
    "**Quedar** is a regular **-AR verb**",
    "No spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Multiple meanings depending on context:",
    "To remain, to stay, to be left",
    "To meet up, to arrange to meet",
    "To fit (clothing): *La camisa me queda bien* (The shirt fits me well)",
    "To be located: *¿Dónde queda el banco?* (Where is the bank located?)",
    "Often used reflexively: **quedarse** (to stay, to remain)",
    "Common usage: *Quedan tres días* (Three days remain), *Quedamos a las 5* (We're meeting at 5), *Me quedé en casa* (I stayed home)"
  ],
